    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559530/extras/1db979b2ca427992fe19c521b622b985.avif?t=1748064262\" /></span><br>This is a Backrooms game created by fans.<br>In this game, the main experience is the &quot;Level!&quot; in Backroom(or &quot;Run For Your Life&quot;).<br>You can run a real ten kilometers (if you want to).<br><strong>The main experience in the game is:</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Level</h2>&quot;Level !&quot;  A ten kilometer corridor, with red lights and alarms, fleeing entities in the corridor.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u5b50\u5c42\u7ea7</h2>&quot;Level !-!&quot;  The red hotel corridor, where soul and reason will twist.<br>&quot;Level -!&quot;  Corridor with scheduled power outages, be careful of entities in the hierarchy.<br>&quot;Level \u00a1&quot;  A square corridor, when the blue light is on, you need to stay still.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559530/extras/9d2dbb05f8fd9be585c73bc602d2aab3.poster.avif?t=1748064262\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559530/extras/9d2dbb05f8fd9be585c73bc602d2aab3.webm?t=1748064262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559530/extras/9d2dbb05f8fd9be585c73bc602d2aab3.mp4?t=1748064262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
